      "Lexical checkout plus all named directory identities are still reopened and compared before and after every installation and before return.",
      "Expected files retain exact-byte checks before bundle publication and in the final set; content failures cannot create a new bundle.",
      "R2 leaves transaction_staging, contracts, public stage_bytes behavior, bundle parity/error order/deep-copy behavior, production process/network purity and pinned compatibility unchanged from the otherwise accepted R1 source review."
